    "data": {
      "text": "Scrape a list of JASP module and their release assets from GitHub and save as src/index.json export GITHUB_TOKEN= pnpm scrape pnpm start\n\nApplication will be running at http://localhost:3000 (unless stated otherwise).\n\nSee [CONTRIBUTING.md] CONTRIBUTING.md#you-want-to-develop-web-app-inside-jasp-stats for development within JASP stats desktop application.\n\nBuilding For Production\n\nTo build run:\n\npnpm scrape pnpm build\n\n## Testing\n\nYou can run the tests with:\n\npnpm test\n\n## Linting and Formatting\n\nCan be typechecked with:\n\npnpm typecheck\n\nCan be formatted and linted with:\n\npnpm check\n\n## Multi language Support\n\nThe ./intlayer.config.ts file contains list of supported locales. Translations are stored in src/*/.content.tsx files.\n\nThe linting is done with TypeScript. Types for translations can be generated with:\n\npnpm dev or\n\npnpm typecheck or\n\npnpx intlayer build or\n\n[VS code extension] https://intlayer.org/doc/vs-code-extension\n\n## Contributing\n\nContributions are welcome! Please read the [contributing guidelines] CONTRIBUTING.md for more information.",
      "section": "Scrape a list of JASP module and their release assets from GitHub and save as src/index.json + Building For Production",
      "repo": "337_JASP_modules_app",
      "source_file": "readme.md"
